//gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177422662,"discussion_id":"bcb3513b3a765902e156686eb62b6505f786be47","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 将 `FusedMulAddAdd` 算子的 shape 推导逻辑从原来的广播推导（`InferShape4Broadcast`）改为与 `op_proto` 对齐的新行为：输出 shape 直接取第一个输入 `x1` 的 shape，且不再支持动态 shape。同时更新了对应的单元测试，使所有测试用例的期望输出 shape 和预期返回值与新的语义一致。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`InferShape4FusedMulAddAdd` 函数重写**：移除了对 `InferShape4Broadcast` 的调用，改为手动获取四个输入 shape、进行空指针检查，并将输出 shape 直接赋值为 `*x1Shape`，不再执行广播计算。\n\n- **动态 shape 检查与拒绝**：新增对所有输入的 `IsUnknownRank` / `IsUnknownShape` 检测，若任一输入为动态 shape 则输出警告日志并返回 `GRAPH_FAILED`。\n\n- **头文件替换**：将 `#include \"op_common/op_host/infershape_broadcast_util.h\"` 替换为 `#include \"op_common/op_host/util/shape_util.h\"`，以配合新的 shape 工具函数使用。\n\n- **单元测试用例同步更新**：所有涉及广播的测试用例的期望输出 shape 改为 `x1` 的原始 shape（如 `{16,1}` 替代 `{16,16}`、`{1}` 替代 `{3,4}` 等），动态 shape / 动态 rank 的测试用例期望返回值从 `GRAPH_SUCCESS` 改为 `GRAPH_FAILED`，期望输出 shape 清空。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-27T10:59:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T10:59:05+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177424124,"discussion_id":"7bf5e40c527197a741e42f983d8588a66db12eda","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 |\n|--------|------|\n| P0 | 0 |\n| P1 | 0 |\n| P2 | 0 |\n| P3 | 1 |\n\n**已审查文件：**\n- `math/fused_mul_add_add/op_host/fused_mul_add_add_infershape.cpp` — 无问题\n- `math/fused_mul_add_add/tests/ut/op_host/test_fused_mul_add_add_infershape.cpp` — 1 个 P3 问题（测试用例名称误导）\n\n**总体评估：** 此变更风险较低。实现逻辑正确地将输出 shape 设置为 x1 的 shape，并正确拒绝了动态 shape 输入。所有测试用例的预期值均已与新行为对齐。唯一的瑕疵是修改后的测试用例保留了包含 \"broadcast\" 的历史命名，可能对后续维护造成轻微混淆。\n\n> ⚠️ 已识别出整体风险，但无法提取行内评论，请参考整体评估。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-27T11:04:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T11:04:52+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177581475,"discussion_id":"5bb9632247b998d9fa1397957a9b3f7adf462aec","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-06-29T10:09:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T10:09:50+08:00","user":{"id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","login":"songkai111","object_id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","name":"songkai111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/songkai111"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177581622,"discussion_id":"0da9203e5813507ac4c50813dc0cd36c64f04ae6","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-06-29T10:10:32+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T10:10:32+08:00","user":{"id":"68ad1e460f9a7255ef7a79e1","login":"pingchuantang","object_id":"68ad1e460f9a7255ef7a79e1","name":"TangPC","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/cc/cb/54c196c65c928b997e66a9d6e53d357e4a5c63e61d32874f3d3a5953d364de62.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/pingchuantang"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177581626,"discussion_id":"f0cc76697c3aa8bdd9c8cd84b0e02142a8fbd4ea","body":"### Review Code Warning \n [@pingchuantang](https://gitcode.com/pingchuantang) , You can't review code by yourself, please contact the reviewers. :astonished: ","created_at":"2026-06-29T10:10:33+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T10:10:33+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177679166,"discussion_id":"66b608e96a36b45f4b1f442c41ed7c82981f8f31","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-06-29T17:56:08+08:00","updated_a